  <Title type="string">Towards drawing with a ladder</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Saoirse Achterberg talks about the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</synopsis>
